{"id": 108566801, "slug": "contagion-comes-for-credit-suisse", "title": "Contagion Comes for Credit Suisse", "subtitle": "The market is now actively hunting weak banks, again.", "post_date": "2023-03-15T12:25:15.863Z", "audience": "everyone", "wordcount": 486, "reaction_count": 5, "comment_count": 0, "restacks": 1, "reactions": {"\u2764": 5}, "body_html": "<p>We\u2019re calling it.</p><div class=\"twitter-embed\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://twitter.com/abcampbell/status/1635969017977479169?s=20&quot;,&quot;full_text&quot;:&quot;Credit Suisse is done.\\n\\nBailout or bankruptcy time. &quot;,&quot;username&quot;:&quot;abcampbell&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Alexander Campbell&quot;,&quot;profile_image_url&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;date&quot;:&quot;Wed Mar 15 11:39:43 +0000 2023&quot;,&quot;photos&quot;:[{&quot;img_url&quot;:&quot;https://pbs.substack.com/media/FrQg-2YWwAEVCAh.jpg&quot;,&quot;link_url&quot;:&quot;https://t.co/D0hDsO2WUC&quot;,&quot;alt_text&quot;:null}],&quot;quoted_tweet&quot;:{},&quot;reply_count&quot;:0,&quot;retweet_count&quot;:0,&quot;like_count&quot;:0,&quot;impression_count&quot;:0,&quot;expanded_url&quot;:{},&quot;video_url&quot;:null,&quot;video_preview_media_key&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false}\" data-component-name=\"Twitter2ToDOM\"></div><p>Readers of this newsletter know we have been tracking this problem for some time. </p><div class=\"embedded-post-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;id&quot;:76338372,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://campbellramble.substack.com/p/why-is-everyone-talking-about-credit&quot;,&quot;publication_id&quot;:312411,&quot;embedding_publication_id&quot;:null,&quot;publication_name&quot;:&quot;Campbell Ramble&quot;,&quot;publication_logo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcfe3791b-6bb6-4230-8940-054d6dd3133f_332x332.png&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Why is everyone talking about Credit Suisse's CDS?&quot;,&quot;truncated_body_text&quot;:&quot;Why is everyone talking about Credit Suisse's CDS and how we can use that to understand the overall credit stress in the economy? From - a guy who used to trade CDS and volatility at Lehman. Thanks for reading Campbell Ramble! Subscribe for free to receive new posts and support my work.&quot;,&quot;date&quot;:&quot;2022-10-06T18:24:40.736Z&quot;,&quot;like_count&quot;:4,&quot;comment_count&quot;:0,&quot;bylines&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:23243013,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Alexander Campbell&quot;,&quot;previous_name&quot;:null,&quot;photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://bucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/9b105c7a-be33-446c-8823-b297b83d0062_512x512.jpeg&quot;,&quot;bio&quot;:&quot;Founder rose.ai, fmr global macro investor at Bridgewater and Lehman&quot;,&quot;profile_set_up_at&quot;:&quot;2021-11-10T02:40:15.283Z&quot;,&quot;publicationUsers&quot;:[],&quot;is_guest&quot;:false,&quot;bestseller_tier&quot;:null,&quot;inviteAccepted&quot;:true}],&quot;utm_campaign&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;newsletter&quot;,&quot;language&quot;:&quot;en&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"EmbeddedPostToDOM\"><a class=\"embedded-post\" native=\"true\" href=\"https://campbellramble.substack.com/p/why-is-everyone-talking-about-credit?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_campaign=post_embed&amp;utm_medium=web\"><div class=\"embedded-post-header\"><img class=\"embedded-post-publication-logo\" src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!KTpD!,w_56,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcfe3791b-6bb6-4230-8940-054d6dd3133f_332x332.png\"><span class=\"embedded-post-publication-name\">Campbell Ramble</span></div><div class=\"embedded-post-title-wrapper\"><div class=\"embedded-post-title\">Why is everyone talking about Credit Suisse's CDS?</div></div><div class=\"embedded-post-body\">Why is everyone talking about Credit Suisse's CDS and how we can use that to understand the overall credit stress in the economy? From - a guy who used to trade CDS and volatility at Lehman. Thanks for reading Campbell Ramble! Subscribe for free to receive new posts and support my work\u2026</div><div class=\"embedded-post-cta-wrapper\"><span class=\"embedded-post-cta\">Read more</span></div><div class=\"embedded-post-meta\">4 years ago \u00b7 4 likes \u00b7 Alexander Campbell</div></a></div><p>More recent readers know we\u2019ve discussed the underlying mechanics of financial crises in depth.  Every crisis is the same, but the assets and players are different.</p><p>Leverage.  Tightening. Stress.  </p><p>Then it\u2019s bailout or bankruptcy time.</p><div class=\"embedded-post-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;id&quot;:107992807,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://campbellramble.substack.com/p/contagion-comes-to-california&quot;,&quot;publication_id&quot;:312411,&quot;embedding_publication_id&quot;:null,&quot;publication_name&quot;:&quot;Campbell Ramble&quot;,&quot;publication_logo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcfe3791b-6bb6-4230-8940-054d6dd3133f_332x332.png&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Contagion Comes to California&quot;,&quot;truncated_body_text&quot;:&quot;Every financial crisis is the same, but the players are different. We wrote about this a couple of years ago. Back when we were on the road trying to protect people from the very kind of economic shock we are currently experiencing.Thanks for reading Campbell Ramble! Subscribe for free to receive new posts and support my work.&quot;,&quot;date&quot;:&quot;2023-03-12T23:11:04.156Z&quot;,&quot;like_count&quot;:2,&quot;comment_count&quot;:0,&quot;bylines&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:27115489,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Alexander Campbell&quot;,&quot;previous_name&quot;:&quot;Rose Technology&quot;,&quot;photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/379c1d87-b451-4988-a7e8-96ea6ded8dec_578x546.jpeg&quot;,&quot;bio&quot;:&quot;Founder Rose.AI\\nPreviously at Bridgewater, Lehman. &quot;,&quot;profile_set_up_at&quot;:&quot;2022-10-09T23:44:50.985Z&quot;,&quot;publicationUsers&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:194486,&quot;user_id&quot;:27115489,&quot;publication_id&quot;:312411,&quot;role&quot;:&quot;admin&quot;,&quot;public&quot;:true,&quot;is_primary&quot;:false,&quot;publication&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:312411,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Campbell Ramble&quot;,&quot;subdomain&quot;:&quot;campbellramble&quot;,&quot;custom_domain&quot;:null,&quot;custom_domain_optional&quot;:false,&quot;hero_text&quot;:&quot;Occasional observations about markets, data, and the broader world.&quot;,&quot;logo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/cfe3791b-6bb6-4230-8940-054d6dd3133f_332x332.png&quot;,&quot;author_id&quot;:27115489,&quot;theme_var_background_pop&quot;:&quot;#FF0000&quot;,&quot;created_at&quot;:&quot;2021-03-12T02:25:31.479Z&quot;,&quot;rss_website_url&quot;:null,&quot;email_from_name&quot;:&quot;Alexander Campbell from Rose&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;Alexander Campbell&quot;,&quot;founding_plan_name&quot;:null,&quot;community_enabled&quot;:true,&quot;invite_only&quot;:false,&quot;payments_state&quot;:&quot;disabled&quot;}}],&quot;twitter_screen_name&quot;:&quot;abcampbell&quot;,&quot;is_guest&quot;:false,&quot;bestseller_tier&quot;:null,&quot;inviteAccepted&quot;:true}],&quot;utm_campaign&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;newsletter&quot;,&quot;language&quot;:&quot;en&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"EmbeddedPostToDOM\"><a class=\"embedded-post\" native=\"true\" href=\"https://campbellramble.substack.com/p/contagion-comes-to-california?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_campaign=post_embed&amp;utm_medium=web\"><div class=\"embedded-post-header\"><img class=\"embedded-post-publication-logo\" src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!KTpD!,w_56,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcfe3791b-6bb6-4230-8940-054d6dd3133f_332x332.png\"><span class=\"embedded-post-publication-name\">Campbell Ramble</span></div><div class=\"embedded-post-title-wrapper\"><div class=\"embedded-post-title\">Contagion Comes to California</div></div><div class=\"embedded-post-body\">Every financial crisis is the same, but the players are different. We wrote about this a couple of years ago. Back when we were on the road trying to protect people from the very kind of economic shock we are currently experiencing.Thanks for reading Campbell Ramble! Subscribe for free to receive new posts and support my work\u2026</div><div class=\"embedded-post-cta-wrapper\"><span class=\"embedded-post-cta\">Read more</span></div><div class=\"embedded-post-meta\">4 years ago \u00b7 2 likes \u00b7 Alexander Campbell</div></a></div><p>Folks old enough to remember the 2008 financial crisis will remember how this played out last time.</p><p>The market may have the attention span of a neurodivergent high school kid off their meds for the summer, but it\u2019s pretty good at figuring out *one thing at a time*.</p><p>During the GFC, the questions were:</p><ol><li><p>How much real estate exposure?</p></li><li><p>How much leverage?</p></li><li><p>What happens when the next domino fails.</p></li></ol><p>Where the next domino was the name du jour.   And everyone knew \u2018who\u2019s next.\u2019</p><p>Bear Stearns, Fannie Mae, AIG, Lehman, Merrill, (Morgan Stanley, Goldman)\u2026</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ngco!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa5ffe121-8b5f-4daf-b71b-2ca443828cbc_999x533.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ngco!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa5ffe121-8b5f-4daf-b71b-2ca443828cbc_999x533.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ngco!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa5ffe121-8b5f-4daf-b71b-2ca443828cbc_999x533.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ngco!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa5ffe121-8b5f-4daf-b71b-2ca443828cbc_999x533.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ngco!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa5ffe121-8b5f-4daf-b71b-2ca443828cbc_999x533.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ngco!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa5ffe121-8b5f-4daf-b71b-2ca443828cbc_999x533.png\" width=\"999\" height=\"533\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/a5ffe121-8b5f-4daf-b71b-2ca443828cbc_999x533.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:533,&quot;width&quot;:999,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:113074,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ngco!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa5ffe121-8b5f-4daf-b71b-2ca443828cbc_999x533.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ngco!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa5ffe121-8b5f-4daf-b71b-2ca443828cbc_999x533.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ngco!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa5ffe121-8b5f-4daf-b71b-2ca443828cbc_999x533.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ngco!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa5ffe121-8b5f-4daf-b71b-2ca443828cbc_999x533.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-tqxFUX\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-tqxFUX\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>See when it comes down to it.  </p><p>Trading financials in a financial crisis is actually pretty easy.</p><p>Rank the banks.</p><p>Short the bad ones.</p><p>Buy the good ones (if you want to be market neutral).</p><p>Stay away from risk until the bailout is in the works.</p><p>Monitor asset drawdowns and bank funding conditions to gauge how much pain is coming down the pipe.</p><p>Well.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mF9x!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2706fa97-17e1-4647-9e71-3c254e8d0161_809x530.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mF9x!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2706fa97-17e1-4647-9e71-3c254e8d0161_809x530.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mF9x!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2706fa97-17e1-4647-9e71-3c254e8d0161_809x530.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mF9x!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2706fa97-17e1-4647-9e71-3c254e8d0161_809x530.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mF9x!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2706fa97-17e1-4647-9e71-3c254e8d0161_809x530.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mF9x!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2706fa97-17e1-4647-9e71-3c254e8d0161_809x530.png\" width=\"809\" height=\"530\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/2706fa97-17e1-4647-9e71-3c254e8d0161_809x530.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:530,&quot;width&quot;:809,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:87436,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mF9x!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2706fa97-17e1-4647-9e71-3c254e8d0161_809x530.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mF9x!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2706fa97-17e1-4647-9e71-3c254e8d0161_809x530.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mF9x!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2706fa97-17e1-4647-9e71-3c254e8d0161_809x530.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mF9x!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2706fa97-17e1-4647-9e71-3c254e8d0161_809x530.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-tqxFUX\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-tqxFUX\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>No bueno.</p><p>What\u2019s different this time is that the balance sheet problems facing the banks are not due to credit losses (yet). </p><p>But rather a rather understandable reaction to the regulatory overhaul in the wake of the global financial crisis.</p><p>When you tell banks that government bonds are risk free, and then lower rates to 0 for the better part of 10 years, what do you expect them to do?</p><p>When inflation forces tightening that crushes the present value of those \u2018risk-free\u2019 assets, policymakers really aren\u2019t left with many options.</p><p>Lower rates, risk blowing out long term yields as markets price in sustained stagflation.</p><div class=\"twitter-embed\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://twitter.com/dampedspring/status/1635825307214049281?s=20&quot;,&quot;full_text&quot;:&quot;<span class=\\&quot;tweet-fake-link\\&quot;>@GlobalMacroZen</span> <span class=\\&quot;tweet-fake-link\\&quot;>@BobEUnlimited</span> <span class=\\&quot;tweet-fake-link\\&quot;>@0xHamz</span> <span class=\\&quot;tweet-fake-link\\&quot;>@biancoresearch</span> Because a cut would cause long term rates to explode higher on unanchored inflation killing the unhedged banks&quot;,&quot;username&quot;:&quot;dampedspring&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Andy Constan&quot;,&quot;profile_image_url&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;date&quot;:&quot;Wed Mar 15 02:08:40 +0000 2023&quot;,&quot;photos&quot;:[],&quot;quoted_tweet&quot;:{},&quot;reply_count&quot;:0,&quot;retweet_count&quot;:0,&quot;like_count&quot;:5,&quot;impression_count&quot;:0,&quot;expanded_url&quot;:{},&quot;video_url&quot;:null,&quot;video_preview_media_key&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true}\" data-component-name=\"Twitter2ToDOM\"></div><p>Keep tightening, further invert the yield curve, crushing bank profitability at a time when they need to rebuild balance sheet equity.</p><div class=\"twitter-embed\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://twitter.com/abcampbell/status/1634023205353521153?s=20&quot;,&quot;full_text&quot;:&quot;Reminder folks, an inverted yield curve is *bad* for banks. \\n\\nBorrow @ 7%\\n\\nInvest in Bonds @ 3.5%\\n\\nWhat could possibly go wrong? &quot;,&quot;username&quot;:&quot;abcampbell&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Alexander Campbell&quot;,&quot;profile_image_url&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;date&quot;:&quot;Fri Mar 10 02:47:45 +0000 2023&quot;,&quot;photos&quot;:[{&quot;img_url&quot;:&quot;https://pbs.substack.com/media/Fq03cZ8WAAIwroQ.jpg&quot;,&quot;link_url&quot;:&quot;https://t.co/ewzBzhEhEx&quot;,&quot;alt_text&quot;:null}],&quot;quoted_tweet&quot;:{},&quot;reply_count&quot;:0,&quot;retweet_count&quot;:0,&quot;like_count&quot;:17,&quot;impression_count&quot;:0,&quot;expanded_url&quot;:{},&quot;video_url&quot;:null,&quot;video_preview_media_key&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true}\" data-component-name=\"Twitter2ToDOM\"></div><p>Rock meet hard place.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><div class=\"image-link image2\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!OXG1!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd7e1f458-489d-4a95-a048-c4bcd2be1d63_271x125.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!OXG1!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd7e1f458-489d-4a95-a048-c4bcd2be1d63_271x125.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!OXG1!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd7e1f458-489d-4a95-a048-c4bcd2be1d63_271x125.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!OXG1!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd7e1f458-489d-4a95-a048-c4bcd2be1d63_271x125.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!OXG1!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd7e1f458-489d-4a95-a048-c4bcd2be1d63_271x125.jpeg\" width=\"531\" height=\"244.92619926199262\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/d7e1f458-489d-4a95-a048-c4bcd2be1d63_271x125.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:125,&quot;width&quot;:271,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:531,&quot;bytes&quot;:null,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:null,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!OXG1!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd7e1f458-489d-4a95-a048-c4bcd2be1d63_271x125.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!OXG1!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd7e1f458-489d-4a95-a048-c4bcd2be1d63_271x125.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!OXG1!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd7e1f458-489d-4a95-a048-c4bcd2be1d63_271x125.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!OXG1!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd7e1f458-489d-4a95-a048-c4bcd2be1d63_271x125.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div></div></div></div></figure></div><p>Mr Market, meet my friend Credit Suisse.  </p><p>Think you two will really hit it off.</p><div class=\"subscription-widget-wrap-editor\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://www.campbellramble.ai/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe&quot;,&quot;language&quot;:&quot;en&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"SubscribeWidgetToDOM\"><div class=\"subscription-widget show-subscribe\"><div class=\"preamble\"><p class=\"cta-caption\">Thanks for r